    "value": "EUR functional currency. IAS7 pre-2027 ordinary entity: interest paid classified operating consistently with prior period; principal payments financing gross. First-year continuing cash-flow hedge of future benchmark interest on remaining USD800; no current derivative settlement or reserve recycling. Qualified independent whole-instrument valuation and separately measured risk are required. No cash equivalents, covenant waiver or legal conclusions are inferred."
